},"body":"See Redis spec in https://redis.io/commands/ping and https://redis.io/topics/protocol.\r\nThis causes an issue when using the `StackExchange.Redis` C# driver (due to  [this line](https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/blob/master/StackExchange.Redis/StackExchange/Redis/ResultProcessor.cs#L1380))\r\n\r\nCurrently we set a standard string response for `PING` here\r\nhttps://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/blob/master/src/yb/yql/redis/redisserver/redis_commands.cc#L263\r\nThen serialize every string response to a bulk response later:\r\nhttps://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/blob/master/src/yb/yql/redis/redisserver/redis_rpc.cc#L269\r\n\r\nWe could treat `PING` as a special case (like we we do with e.g. `kOkResponse ` responses), or add a  \"simple_string\" case in `RedisResponsePB`.\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"vitsai","id":7005244,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMDUyNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7005244?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitsai","html_url":"https://github.com/vitsai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitsai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitsai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitsai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitsai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitsai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitsai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitsai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitsai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vitsai/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/345/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yuga